  "readOn": "2026-09-05",
  "readFrom": "The project owner's page-by-page index of what the booklet illustrates, mapped to this book's slugs. The booklet itself was not transcribed.",
  "rights": "Third-party. The drawings are the author's and none is reproduced here; this record is an index of what the booklet illustrates, by printed page, so that a technique, a name or a sequence can be cited to it as existing. Page numbers are the printed ones.",
  "note": {
    "en": "An index, not a transcription, so it proves that a technique or a pairing is illustrated and nothing more. A sequence cited to it carries an about written from this book's own technique records; the booklet supplies the pairing and the page. Where it prints a name the Kodokan does not use, the name is recorded on the technique it maps to and the mapping is in this file."
  },
  "structure": {
    "en": "Standing techniques pp 4-21; combinations pp 22-34; counters pp 35-43; hold-downs pp 44-48 and their escapes pp 49-54; strangles pp 55-65 and escapes pp 66-69; armlocks pp 70-79 and escapes pp 80-84; ground entries pp 85-94; annexes on grades and classification pp 95-102, glossary pp 103-118, competition and refereeing under the 2006 rules pp 119-123, history pp 124-127."
  },
